2) Download the artifact with `artisan get`,
3) Parse the RQ3 notebook JSON to extract the k and “Impact on VM time” values, convert them to negative one-decimal percentages, and write the full markdown table to `/workspace/repro.txt`,
4) Run `artisan format` and wrap it with the required `<artisan_submit>` tags,
